      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَدَنٌ</span></b>  <i>A</i> [<i>pavilion,</i> or <i>building of the kind termed</i>]
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصْر</span>, (S, M, A, K,) <i>raised high,</i> or <i>made lofty:</i>
(M, K:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفْدَانٌ</span>; (M, A;) to which fat camels
are likened. (A. [See 2.]) ＝   
